//- Seam (§S4.2): section.tag-page, the tag pages of @nera-static/plugin-tags.
//- In scope: meta, app. It owns the page's <h1>. A site with the plugin
//- overrides it with:
//-     include /vendor/plugin-tags/pages/tag-overview
//- Without the plugin: the page title and body.
h1.page__title= meta.title || app.name
.page__body
    != content
